0..80 Comment "//! The lowering refuses an attribute before a theory member outside its places."
81..84 Comment "//!"
85..164 Comment "//! A block before a sort, an operation or a rule of a theory reads through the"
165..238 Comment "//! general reader of attributes. The registry gives each name the set of"
239..311 Comment "//! places where it stands. A mark of the presentation must stand at the"
312..338 Comment "//! member that it shapes."
339..342 Comment "//!"
343..419 Comment "//! The lowering refuses each name at another place as `MisplacedAttribute`."
420..497 Comment "//! The refusal names the places that the name takes. The theory around it is"
498..518 Comment "//! refused with it."
519..522 Comment "//!"
523..539 Comment "//! - see: #6404"
